Subject: [PATCH 2/5] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20pre-gated=20prefetch=20review=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20main=20context=20only,=20pinned-source/device=20che?=
 =?UTF-8?q?cks=20per=20layer,=20owner-safe=20release?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- register the backend only from the DEFAULT context; an in-model MTP draft context shares the model but not its streams
- release only the registered backend, after the context's synchronize (was: before it, and for any context)
- per layer pf_ok: slots on the registered backend's device and pinned host experts, else that layer is not prefetched (a
  pageable source makes cudaMemcpyAsync sync the stream; a slot on another device asserts in set_tensor_async)
- build the prediction only when this layer runs the cache chain and the next router is device-resident; clamp top-k
- document the syncs the staging buffer relies on
