MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- host_first is now a builder that build_moe_ffn calls only when it builds this layer's cache chain (ahead of the barrier), so
  a prediction can no longer be left without a consumer (uncached layer, LoRA, non-qualifying next layer)
- llama_moe_cache_prefetch_ok(key_next): the next layer must qualify before anything is built
- a second registration while a backend is bound is refused (logged)
- layer qualification is recomputed on resume(); while suspended it is judged by the recorded slot buffer type
- LLAMA_MOE_PREFETCH_TOUCH=0 disables the LRU refresh of predicted cached experts (measurable in the sweep)
