Subject: [PATCH 5/5] =?UTF-8?q?perf:=20pre-gated=20prefetch=20window=20mod?=
 =?UTF-8?q?e=20=E2=80=94=20L+2=20misses=20on=20a=20copy=20stream=20in=20th?=
